{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"851694513068179477","content":"bones hangs around the clock tower.","created_at":"2021-07-11T15:59:29.936000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863811749538955304","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"851694513068179477","content":"Standing before the tower I square my shoulders and grit my teeth. A wave of my hand cleans the shite and feathers off of my coat, and makes my trio of attending pigeons gleam in the morning sun. \n\nWhen I speak my voice is magically amplified, and I begin hollaring at passerby in my halting accent: \"Brave the Clock Tower! Brave the Clock Tower? Brave! the Clock. Tower. Bravetheclocktower!\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T16:01:01.897000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863812135251738674","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"851694513068179477","content":"\"you curious bout this thing? i'd be careful, rumor is a buncha kids went in last year. nobody's heard even a mutter bout them since.\" he gives a rasped cackle. \"but we got all sorta stories round the city.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T16:05:35.243000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863813281746386944","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"851694513068179477","content":"\"Yes, sir! That is just the rumor, I had heard, as well. I won't. Go in. Alone, but I would love to see the inside. Perhaps, you. Would like to join me?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T16:07:58.288000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863813881721126942","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"851694513068179477","content":"\"well, i like to help folk not hurt themselves round ere. i've been thinkin bout it too\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T16:09:13.080000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863814195421642772","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"851694513068179477","content":"\"I am called Wintergreen. The large, pigeon. Her name is. Dolores. The other two, have not divulged. Names.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T16:12:22.225000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863814988753928234","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"851694513068179477","content":"\"ah you got some of them follow you, don't worry about it too much. pigeons aren't too bad... usually.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T16:13:21.092000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863815235659628564","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"851694513068179477","content":"\"Yes, ah. They don't seem to harbor any . . . ill. Will. But they are very close. To me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T16:14:19.041000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863815478714957834","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"851694513068179477","content":"\"they do that a lot. they go crazy over any bread you give'em though. i see a bunch of nutjobs just throwing handfuls all over the place for them. it's like a cult or somethin\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T16:17:04.498000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863816172692570132","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
